abstract: >-
  A repository for The Demure Fulcrum, a conceptual framework and research
  agenda proposing negotiation as an agency-preserving higher-order
  meta-response under threat. The work is a working paper and has not been
  peer reviewed or empirically validated as a distinct psychological construct.
keywords:
  - agency
  - negotiation
  - threat response
  - coping
  - appraisal
  - behavioural science
  - game transformation
